       "mota": "testua",
       "html": "Lehen ordena: <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math> Bigarren ordena (geziarekin: alderantziz): <math display=\"block\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>y</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></math>"
